<p style="line-height:1.38; margin-top:16px; margin-bottom:16px"><span style="font-size:11px;"><span style="font-family:Georgia,Times New Roman,Times,serif;"><span style="font-variant: normal; white-space: pre-wrap;"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">It’s designed to help you connect with leads that generate the most lifetime value for your agency — including shoppers who are more likely to bind based on key traits like age range, business ownership, and intent level.</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>

<p style="line-height:1.38; margin-top:16px; margin-bottom:16px"><span style="font-size:11px;"><span style="font-family:Georgia,Times New Roman,Times,serif;"><span style="font-variant: normal; white-space: pre-wrap;"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">Agents using this feature are already seeing impressive results. Do you have any availability this week to connect and see if it's a good fit for your agency? If so, feel free to book some time on my calendar </span></span></span></span></span></span></span><a href="https://everquote.chilipiper.com/me/jaida-lightford/meeting-with-jlightford">here</a> <span style="font-size:11px;"><span style="font-family:Georgia,Times New Roman,Times,serif;"><span style="font-variant: normal; white-space: pre-wrap;"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">.</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><br />
